      <activity id="e362b67d-3001-59e8-b4ad-5f345aede084" activityNameId="523cf4b8-5b70-5049-96ba-911bb37e9bdd" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Biogas purification, to methane, 99 vol-%, amino washing process</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Biogas purification, to methane, 99 vol-%, amino washing process
Inventory refers to 1 m3 of methane. Electricity consumption and emissions represent the raw gas compression, H2S removal, gas conditioning and methane enrichment of biogas.  Infrastructure expenditures are included employing generic data for facilities of a chemical plant as approximation.;
UUID: a95731d9-5ad8-3f5c-aafa-e3f98a6f8b10
Emissions due to leakage and purification of biogas. Input of energy and auxiliary materials. Biogas input excluded from the dataset.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland. Production occurs at Viessmann in Berlin (DE).
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by factories 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a95731d9-5ad8-3f5c-aafa-e3f98a6f8b10.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
